<title>BELGIUM: EU tenders for supply of vegetable oil food aid.</title>
<headline>EU tenders for supply of vegetable oil food aid.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union invited tenders by April 22 for the supply of a total of 1,360 tonnes of vegetable oils as food aid to four countries, according to the EU Official Journal obtained on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The notice, published on Tuesday, invites tenders for 90 tonnes of soyoil for Cuba, 1,170 tonnes of rape oil or refined sunflower oil for Madagascar and Uganda and 100 tonnes of refined rape or refined sunflower oil for Georgia.</p>
<p>The vegetable oils should be delivered to the ports of shipment between May 12 and June 8.</p>
</text>
